POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Short Username User","username":"ab","email":"short.username@example.test","password":"ValidPassword123"}

### Assignment 7: Password shorter than 8 characters (expected 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Short Password User","username":"shortpassword","email":"short.password@example.test","password":"short"}

